    "Current tooling is exactly12 fixed rows, each under256KiB and aggregate8MiB, matching the separately approved collector/workflowR2 table. The collector self is separately literal-pinned to33324/263f47d7 and actual Git. It is not included as a thirteenth row. The legacy56, current60 and current12 envelopes remain separately named and bounded, including stored4MiB/decoded8MiB envelope limits.",
