    "The98 disjoint additions are three source/scope positives,60 fixed-current-object byte mutations,14 unknown/missing identity route mutations, one tooling positive,13 fixed tooling/self mutations, one95-role positive, four closed-role mutations and two fixed-table-definition mutations. Combined306 names are unique. These are planned source controls, not observed passes or deep-branch coverage behind immutable hash rejection.",
